There is a guest named Maya, who came from Brooklyn, who put it plainly in the note she left: *"We pulled crab pots at sunrise and watched osprey work the creek. Three days later none of us wanted to leave."* That is the whole of it, really. The morning organizes itself. You just have to get up for it.

